      "id": "2064841063169175726",
      "text": "Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei on stage at Code with Claude 2026:\n\n\"We tried to plan very well for a world of 10x growth per year. Yet we saw 80x.\"\n\nThe room went quiet.\n\nMost people still argue if AI is a bubble. They try a couple of prompts and wait for the hype to die.\n\nThe winners stopped arguing and started building. Two-person companies running on AI are already worth a billion dollars.\n\nSave this post. Read it again in December",
