      "text": "AI created this video with in 15 minutes and under a $1 with minimal guidance. I just stitched it together...\n\nThe script, the images, the video, the voice, everything. It's rough around the edges but the capability is insane.\n\nAI is causing massive disruption in marketing.\n\nThe barrier to entry became so low, anyone can be anybody for any brand.\n\nThe best thing you can do is to learn marketing and AI content creation in general.\n\nThere are so many ways to monetize this skill.",
