      "id": "2064404258599108956",
      "text": "The Fable 5 benchmarks look really impressive, but do they justify the cost? It literally burns through my tokens in a couple of prompts and overthinks quite often even for simple tasks. It is also verbose by default directly translating to a token drain. The intelligence is there, but at what cost?",
